///     custom_resource:
///       group: stable.example.com
///       version: v1
///       resource: crontabs
/// ```
///
/// ### Watch Events
///
/// Each message includes the watch event type in metadata:
/// - **ADDED**: Resource was created
/// - **MODIFIED**: Resource was updated
/// - **DELETED**: Resource was removed
///
///
